 "director": {
  "mode": "hand",
  "notes": "Geometric near Allah's name, night and day for «الظلمات والنور», an hourglass for «أجلا». 3:1-6 «وهو الله في السماوات وفي الأرض» is glossed with As-Sa'di's «المألوه المعبود» (the One worshipped in the heavens and the earth). No Adam figure; 4-5 are staged (see STAGING v4). STAGING v4: 1-3 (praise, creation, the term, His knowledge) stay ambient; the geometric plate on 3:2 now lasts to 3:7. 4-5: three deniers in a town at dusk; a sign plate (burst) on 4:2-4:5, gone before 4:7; they turn their backs on 4:10 (As-Sa'di: they turned their backs on the signs), shake their heads on 5:2 (they denied), speak on 5:12 (mocking); an hourglass on 5:6 for the news that will come. No messenger drawn."
 },
